WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:03.102
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:05.070
I'm here with Steve Higgins,
and we're about to play

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.174
a brand-new game called
"Imposter Challenge."

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:10.476
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:14.047
-♪ Imposter Challenge ♪

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:16.482
But first,
we're gonna need some help.

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:19.352
He's a five-time
Grammy-nominated...

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.754
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:23.622
...musician, and his music
has been streamed

00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:25.825
over 30 billion times.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.426
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:31.363
His new solo album,
"D-DAY," is out now.

00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:37.103
Please welcome global pop-music
icon from BTS, Suga!

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:42.441
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:44.444
How you doing?

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.345
Good to see you.

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:49.215
[ Cheers and applause
continues ]

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:54.587
Thank you for --

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:59.458
[ Cheers and applause
continues ]

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:04.163
Thank you for being here.
Uh, Higgins -- Higgins --

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:07.599
Higgins, can you --
Higgins, can you explain how --

00:01:07.599 --> 00:01:10.003
[ Cheering continues ]

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:11.805
-Yes, I can, Jimmy!
-Yes.

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:14.807
Explain how the game works.
-Jimmy and Suga will be given

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:18.811
two things to eat
that look identical.

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:21.213
One tastes good...

00:01:21.213 --> 00:01:23.783
and the other does not.
-Okay.

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.451
They must eat
what they are presented with

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:27.286
while trying to convince
the audience

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.255
that they like the taste.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.690
Then the audience will vote

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.826
for who they think
ate the gross thing.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:36.029
There'll be three rounds.
Okay?

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:37.730
-Three rounds. Okay.
-You ready?

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.965
-Yeah, I'm ready.

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:42.068
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:43.736
-All right.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:46.305
For the first round,
we have two spoons.

00:01:46.305 --> 00:01:50.343
One has salt and one has sugar.
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:53.712
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:56.882
Jimmy, you will go first.

00:01:56.882 --> 00:01:58.818
-Go first.

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.520
-You're --
You're my guest.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.689
All right, so one is salt,
one is sugar.

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:05.124
-Jimmy, whenever you're ready.

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:07.693
-All right. And --
-That's your spoon.

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:11.798 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:12.932
Mmmmm!

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.837
Suga, it's your turn.
Eat whenever you are ready.

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:20.673 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.808
[ Cheering ]

00:02:22.808 --> 00:02:31.484 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.853
Okay. Audience?
-No.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:42.195
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:45.331
Okay. Audience,
time to cast your votes.

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.499
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.334
You all have your voting
clickers at your seat.

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:51.537
If you think Jimmy
ate the salt...

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:52.839
-I tried.
-...vote Jimmy.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.741
If you think Suga ate the salt,
vote Suga.

00:02:55.741 --> 00:02:57.710
Ready, guys?
Vote away.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.579
I think it's pretty obvious
who had the salt,

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:01.680
but maybe some people
aren't convinced.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.616
I tried to act like...
-Yeah.

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:04.984
-[ Laughs ]
-Okay.

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.852
-Yep.
All right. The votes are in.

00:03:06.852 --> 00:03:08.854 line:0%
Let's see the results.

00:03:08.854 --> 00:03:10.957 line:0%
-Oh, Jimmy.
The audience thinks Jimmy

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.625
is the imposter.

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:14.260
Jimmy, let's find out
who actually

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.829
ate the salt.
Imposter, reveal yourself.

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:18.464
-He ate the salt.
-I'm the imposter.

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:20.266
-Oh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:23.369 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:25.304
Wow.
-You thought he was acting?

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:26.472
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:28.808
-No, he's just -- He's --
He just took it --

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:30.209
He put his tongue in it
and was like, "Ugh!"

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:31.310
-"I'm not eating that."

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.245
-I put a full spoon
of sugar in there.

00:03:33.245 --> 00:03:34.414
I go, "Oh, my gosh."

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:36.916
But, wow, I love you guys
for believing me.

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:37.951
All right.
-All right.

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:40.053
-All right.
-Ready?

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.287
Time for round 2.
-Okay.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:43.256
-The deuce.
Ready?

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:45.525
You're gonna have
two glasses in front of you.

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:47.960
One has vinegar.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:50.296
[ Audience "Ohhs" ]

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:53.433
The other has water.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.436
-I know. I don't know.

00:03:57.436 --> 00:04:00.473
[ Inhales sharply ]

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:03.409 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:03.409 --> 00:04:05.378
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:07.013
Okay.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:09.348
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.348 --> 00:04:11.283
-Suga, your turn.

00:04:11.283 --> 00:04:13.953 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:17.890
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.158
All right!

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:21.427
Press Jimmy if you think Jimmy
drank the vinegar.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:24.763
Press Suga if you think Suga
drank the vinegar.

00:04:24.763 --> 00:04:27.666
Who drank the vinegar?

00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:31.337
Ready?
Everybody ready?

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:33.272
Okay, the votes are in.

00:04:33.272 --> 00:04:35.708 line:0%
Let's see the results.

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.577 line:0%
The audience thinks Suga
is the imposter.

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:39.912 line:0%
Okay. Let's find out
who drank the vinegar.

00:04:39.912 --> 00:04:42.415
Imposter, reveal yourself.

00:04:42.415 --> 00:04:45.050
-I drank the vinegar.
Ugh!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:48.388
That was disgusting.
That was disgusting, dude!

00:04:48.388 --> 00:04:50.890
I'm crying. I'm crying.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.725
That was disgusting!

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.260
Oh, my gosh.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.861
-Then you're gonna love
this next one.

00:04:55.861 --> 00:04:57.162
[ Audience "Oohs" ]
-Next one?

00:04:57.162 --> 00:04:58.764
-It's time for the final round.

00:04:58.764 --> 00:05:01.934
For this one,
you each have a chicken wing.

00:05:01.934 --> 00:05:05.404
One has no spice --
mmm, tasty.

00:05:05.404 --> 00:05:08.908
The other has been doused
in Trinidad Scorpion Hot sauce.

00:05:08.908 --> 00:05:10.576
[ Laughter, cheers ]

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:13.245
-I never heard of that.
-Well, it's hotter

00:05:13.245 --> 00:05:15.347
than a ghost pepper.
[ Audience "Ohhs" ]

00:05:15.347 --> 00:05:17.216
I think you need
a license to touch it.

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:19.084
Okay.
-But he has to --

00:05:19.084 --> 00:05:21.353
He has to perform tonight.
-Well...

00:05:21.353 --> 00:05:22.521
-He has to sing.
He has to --

00:05:22.521 --> 00:05:23.856
Jimmy, whenever you're ready.

00:05:23.856 --> 00:05:33.866 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:35.334 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:35.334 --> 00:05:40.172
[ Laughter ]
Okay.

00:05:40.172 --> 00:05:43.309
-Okay.
-Okay, Suga. Your turn.

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:47.213 line:0%
♪♪

00:05:47.213 --> 00:05:49.816
[ Cheering ]

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:51.884
Okay.

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:54.487
Gonna count those votes up.

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:56.589
That's scorpion hot pepper.

00:05:56.589 --> 00:05:59.658 line:0%
Votes are in.
Let's see what we got.

00:05:59.658 --> 00:06:01.193 line:0%
They think Jimmy did.

00:06:01.193 --> 00:06:04.163 line:0%
Okay.
Imposter, reveal yourself.

00:06:04.163 --> 00:06:08.834
Oh!
Oh, my God.

00:06:08.834 --> 00:06:12.204
-No vinegar, no hot.

00:06:12.204 --> 00:06:15.140
Well done, audience!

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.176
Well done!
Since you did

00:06:17.176 --> 00:06:19.212
such a great job guessing,

00:06:19.212 --> 00:06:21.380
everyone in the audience
is going home tonight

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.950
with a free pint of
Tonight Dough ice cream.

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.418
[ Dinging ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:26.418 --> 00:06:28.287
My thanks with Suga!

00:06:28.287 --> 00:06:30.189
We'll be talking more to Suga
after the break.

00:06:30.189 --> 00:06:32.091
Stick around, everybody!

